">|</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></munderover><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tĐặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>sin</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>cos</mo><mi>t</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và \n\t\t\t<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>t</mi></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\t\t\tnên \n\t\